 "comment": "Ostby Pasture, the land beside the village (D-1331, D-1354). The party enters from the overworld on the west edge. Two packs of wolves and a pair of crows walk the snowy grass, and the starved boar holds the far east end. The win over the boar plays the join of Bergit one time: she shows on the far bank of the stream, which no step reaches, so no body can stand on her tile. Two chests hold a drill and a cure (D-1343). A dungeon, so it holds no service. The pasture is dusk, and night after the end of the first playable (D-1338, D-1349).",
